<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Becton Dickinson raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Becton Dickinson raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Monday it had raised its rating for medical products company Becton Dickinson and Co to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed on Friday at 39.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
